            "verseId": "NUM.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.1-15:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "muri Bibliya Yera ya mbere, iyi mirongo ni 16.36-50; bityo, 17.1-13 ihwanye na 17.16-28 muri iyi Bibliya, nk'uko biri mu Ruheburayo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwira Eleyazari mwene Aroni umutambyi, akure ibyotero byabo mu muriro ubatwitse, nawe usese umuriro wo muri byo hariya, kuko ibyo ari ibyera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibyotero by'abo banyabyaha bacumuriye ubugingo bwabo ubwabo, babicuremo ibisate byo gutwikira igicaniro, kuko babituriyeho Uwiteka. Ni cyo gitumye biba ibyera, kandi bizabere Abisirayeli ikimenyetso.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eleyazari umutambyi yenda ibyotero by'imiringa abatwitswe baturiyeho, babicuramo igitwikirizo cy'igicaniro ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cyo kubera Abisirayeli urwibutso, kugira ngo hatagira umuntu utari mu rubyaro rwa Aroni wigirira hafi kosereza umubavu imbere y'Uwiteka. Atamera nka Kōra n'abafatanije na we. Eleyazari abikora uko Uwiteka yamutegekeye mu kanwa ka Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aroni ahongerera Abisirayeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye bwaho, iteraniro ry'Abisirayeli ryose ryitotombera Mose na Aroni riti “Mwishe abantu b'Uwiteka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iteraniro riteraniye kugomera Mose na Aroni, bareba berekeje ihema ry'ibonaniro, babona cya gicu kiritwikiriye, ubwiza bw'Uwiteka buraboneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mose na Aroni bajya imbere y'ihema ry'ibonaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nimuhaguruke muve muri iri teraniro ndirimbure mu kanya gato.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikubita hasi bubamye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose abwira Aroni ati “Enda icyotero cyawe, ukure umuriro ku gicaniro uwugishyiremo, uwushyireho umubavu, ukijyane vuba mu iteraniro urihongerere, kuko umujinya uturutse ku Uwiteka, mugiga igatangira gutera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni abyenda uko Mose amubwiye, arirukanka ajya mu iteraniro hagati, asanga mugiga itangiye gutera mu bantu, ashyira umubavu ku muriro, ahongerera abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahagarara hagati y'intumbi n'abazima, mugiga irashira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishwe na mugiga iyo, bari abantu inzovu n'ibihumbi bine na magana arindwi, utabariyemo abicishijwe n'ibya Kōra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni asubira aho Mose ari ku muryango w'ihema ry'ibonaniro, mugiga irashira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inkoni ya Aroni irabya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwira Abisirayeli baguhe inkoni, umuryango wa ba sekuruza wose uvemo inkoni imwe, zitangwe n'abatware babo bose nk'uko amazu ya ba sekuruza ari, inkoni zose zibe cumi n'ebyiri, wandike izina ry'umuntu wese ku nkoni ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandike n'izina rya Aroni ku nkoni y'Abalewi, kuko hazaba inkoni imwe y'umutware w'amazu ya ba sekuruza wese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzibike mu ihema ry'ibonaniro imbere y'Ibihamya, aho mbonanira namwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo nzatoranya inkoni ye izarabya, maze imbere yanjye mare kwitotomba Abisirayeli babitotombera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose abibwira Abisirayeli, abatware babo bose bamuha inkoni, umutware wese amuha inkoni nk'uko amazu ya ba sekuruza ari, zose ziba cumi n'ebyiri, inkoni ya Aroni iba mu zabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose abika izo nkoni imbere y'Uwiteka mu ihema ry'Ibihamya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bukeye bwaho Mose yinjira mu ihema ry'Ibihamya, asanga inkoni ya Aroni yatangiwe inzu ya Lewi irabije, ipfunditse uburabyo, isambuye, imeze indōzi zihishije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose asohora izo nkoni zose zari imbere y'Uwiteka, azishyira Abisirayeli bose barazitegereza, umuntu wese yenda inkoni ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose ati “Subiza inkoni ya Aroni imbere y'Ibihamya, ibikirwe kuba ikimenyetso kigomōra abagome, kugira ngo umareho kunyitotombera kwabo badapfa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko abe ari ko Mose agenza, uko Uwiteka yamutegetse abe ari ko agenza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
